 "name": "reyferro-cc96154",
 "notes": "ROUGH: digitized from a watermarked web image for use as a search seed, not a benchmark.\nSource: Clash Champs base #96154 (https://www.clashchamps.com/i-need-a-base/?search_player_townhalls=16&order_by=1), builder \"Reyferro\", uploaded 2026-04-09, Clash Champs tag \"War\" (508 downloads on 2026-10-21). Image: https://clashchamps.com/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/m4td0QhRkBTnwv62pP40vA/16f1bfd6-09bb-4f3f-1381-6360ebf79300/image1920 (1318x927 village screenshot, dark green scenery, purple building skins, Clash Champs watermark over the centre). Layout link: https://link.clashofclans.com/en/?action=OpenLayout&id=TH16%3AHV%3AAAAANgAAAAJ3uN1e1oa-yquUjHQGjLSA .\nDigitized 2026-10-21. Grid: cx 642.75, top 62.66, a 11.047, b 8.285 (screen = cx + (x-y)a, top + (x+y)b). Slope (ratio 0.750) and line period (2b = 16.57 px) from a comb fit of the wall-cap lines; scale confirmed by a scale scan of the checkered grass (best a 11.04, falls off by half at +-0.15); sub-tile phase from the checkered grass and the wall-cap phase histogram (same cap phase as the 101332 digitization). Integer anchoring from edge buildings: with the first candidate offset the bottom-left edge buildings ended 1 tile outside the village, so the grid was shifted by one tile in y; edge buildings now sit on x = 0 / 43 and y = 0 / 43 (residual sprite-tip bias -0.6..+0.5 tile on all four edges). Decorations outside the grid ignored.\nResolution is low (tile half-width 11 px) and most buildings use purple skins; identities matched against TH16-era sprite references (chiefpansancolt/clash-of-clans-data images). Positions read from the bottom tip of each sprite (+-1 tile); one building clamped into the grid (gm 41,7 from x=42). The base is MERGED as transcribed (3 Cannons, 2 Ricochet Cannons, 4 Archer Towers, 2 Multi-Archer Towers), but both MATs are identity-uncertain (red/brown towers, one under the watermark).\nUncertain identities: the 5 Hidden Teslas are five purple egg-shaped sprites in the core (15,18 15,21 15,24 30,18 30,25); the count matches but they could be traps, in which case the teslas are not visible. bob 1,17 is a dark wooden tower with steps read as B.O.B's Hut. scatter 17,16 (red sprite under watermark) and scatter 27,16 (grey drum on a beige base); sweeper 18,26 and 27,26 (red drums); mat 27,7 (red/brown tower with green crest) and mat 27,34 (red/gold tower under the watermark); banner 17,10 (small yellow flag); ds 0,41 (glass cube read as an empty Dark Elixir Storage); 4 Gold Storages are empty purple boxes; dsf (red cauldron), lab, dbarracks, helper are army/utility buildings read at low confidence. No Crafting Station identified (optional). Modes assumed: infernos single, x-bows both, spell towers rage (purple orbs), sweepers face the centre.\nOverlaps resolved by 1-tile nudges: smith 16,0->17,0, gm 41,13->41,14, xbow 28,13->27,13, scatter 25,16->27,16.\nIMPUTED: none.\nWalls: automatic cap detection (steel highlight of the purple walls + pale caps of the gold/white wall section, sampled 9.2 px above tile centres) minus building footprints, runs of 2+ kept: fewer than 325 (watermark and tall buildings hide some). Traps: none recognised in the screenshot (not transcribed). Levels not set.",
